      "ref": "[D529]",
      "area": "contact",
      "claim": "A scam uses the recipient's real name as the seller on a fake Facebook Marketplace listing to prompt a response.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "You get a text message from a number you don't recognize asking a pretty normal question: \"Is this still available for purchase?\" Attached to the text is an image that appears to show a Facebook Marketplace listing. Maybe you're confused because you don't remember selling anything. Then you look at the seller's name. It's yours."
